  "stageId": "a003_ex03",
  "title": "採訪環節",
  "storyCode": "OF-EX3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_ex03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "5ff9613cb439d3f750ac8d35f0a3d4e9449a495e1db4f3e6f27bc95e7ce0137f",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第一关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "剛才是不是地震了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "對啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "畢竟我們離舞台這麼近哎！看到了嗎！？你看到D.D.D.的表情了嗎！？她是怎麼做到的！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "她已經下台了啦，你不要老是這麼......等等，這不是又在震了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎呀，說不定是低音炮的緣故......慢著。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "哎...哎？你也察覺到了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......快走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什、什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別問那麼多了，快跟我走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "觀眾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不要擠啊！離我遠點！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "觀眾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你踩著我的腳了！！滾開啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "觀眾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "有人暈倒了！小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "怎、怎麼突然都躁動起來了，難道真的是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......我的天。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......是大帝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "嗯哼，天氣不錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "（歡呼聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大帝！是真人！！啊啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "男遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "別蠢了！這都什麼時候了，你竟然還在意地震！？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不，只是，看見大帝，等等，我有點，喘不過氣......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大帝先生，這邊請。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "各位觀眾！請退後！退至線後！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "喂，那個薩弗拉年輕人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "沒關係，讓他們靠近點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "可是大帝先生，您一會還有演出，如果出了什麼意外......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "意外？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "槍擊，刺殺，綁架，自殺威脅，意外是指這些東西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "這些東西能阻止什麼？阻止我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "不，它們會變成我舞台的一部分，就像語言的意義被節奏消解，你明白嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不、不明白......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "簡單來說就是節目效果。放輕鬆，塞壬唱片絕對不會追究你們失責。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "（歡呼聲）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "觀眾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大帝！！大帝！！大帝！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "喔，總算來了，快，不要緊張，放輕鬆，大膽點，相信你自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼西哥倫比亞的饒舌之神，你，你就是個痞子，一個走狗屎運的幸運兒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "大聲點，夥計，大聲說話！喂，薩弗拉人，不要趕他走，把麥克風給他。不要慌，這裡聽我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你毀了我們的生活，你卻坐擁那麼多產業，你......你該去死！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "女遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咿呀——他拔出了一把弩！快躲開！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "不怪我，對，都是你的錯，你所謂的饒舌帝國建立在多少歌手的犧牲之下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "什麼大帝啊，吃屎去吧，你這隻無恥的企鵝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "啊哈，讓我想想，到底是誰在耍一些不入流的小手段？媒體，輿論，人身攻擊，還有槍殺，哼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "你以為在下水道和垃圾堆裡打一圈滾我就認不出你了嗎？對那些年輕人開槍讓你滿足嗎，“歌手”？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "如果不是我恰好有那麼點看不順眼，你們又會繼續“排除”掉多少不合口味的新星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "然後把撈來的鈔票堆在自己的澡盆裡，唾棄著整個哥倫比亞？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "閉嘴！給我去死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "快保護大帝先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大帝先生中彈了，快......欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "開槍的是大帝先生？那傢伙的弩被打飛了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "噠噠噠噠噠，噠！砰！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "真奇怪。和你廢話了這麼多，槍口冒煙的人怎麼是我？猜猜看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "是因為你太沒種，還是我光芒萬丈，你睜不開眼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咕——呃——你隨身帶著銃械......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "如果一個人每天多死個幾次，就會養成隨身攜帶武器的好習慣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "表情古怪的遊客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "咳咳——你以為，只有我一個人嗎？想想你過去招惹的敵人，你走不出這座汐斯塔市的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "我的過去比這邊虛假的海洋還要寬廣，你說的敵人又在哪個不起眼的地方？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大帝先生！觀眾裡面混著很多他們的同夥，我們處理不過來......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "行了，不要這麼慌張。你們就維護好現場的秩序，剩下的交給專業人士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "比如我的，企鵝物流。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "......我怎麼記得我們是來度假的？姑且問一下，有加班費嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "在旅店待了這麼久，的確可以適當運動一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "因為德克薩......因為“空”你一直待在賓館裡看書嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "......好像是還有這個約定。戰鬥的時候反應得過來嗎，德克薩斯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "沒問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "老闆，這裡完工了，要幫我訂明天最前排的套票唷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "保鏢",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "大帝先生，這、這些人是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "就當我們是老闆......是大帝先生的私人保鏢吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "可頌",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "text": "雖然我們是個物流公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "能天使",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "text": "本來我們的業務擴展就很豐富嘛。之前不是還買了一家爵士樂酒吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "還有那些總是被當成沙包的敘拉古黑幫，不過最近安分得有些詭異。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "你以為我們每個月要在龍門打多少次架？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "論鬥毆和火拼，我們才是行家裡手，最頂級的，無人能及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "激動的觀眾",
      "speakerId": null,
      "text": "老子等這一刻好久了！西邊的企鵝！你既然敢光明正大地出現，就等死吧！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "......你們是成立了一個賊喊捉賊協會嗎？好吧，反正也和我想的差不太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大帝",
      "speakerId": "char_105_emper",
      "text": "德克薩斯，動手。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德克薩斯",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "text": "明白——啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "空",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "text": "——明白了！我上了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
